diffhdr_color.py contains functions adapted from DiffHDR's utils/color_utils.py,
infer_video.py and infer_long_video.py (restructured for ComfyUI tensors; numerically
identical results). diffhdr_nodes.py re-implements DiffHDR's inference pipeline on top
of ComfyUI.

This repository does not include any model weights. The DiffHDR LoRA weights
(Eyeline-Labs/DiffHDR) and the Wan2.1-VACE-14B weights (Wan-AI) are distributed by
their authors under their own licences (Apache-2.0 at the time of writing).
